<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/benin-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Benin%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Benin Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">British Punitive Expedition burns Benin City and exiles Oba Ovonramwen</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/joseon"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Joseon.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Joseon</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Gojong proclaims the Korean Empire</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-rwanda"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Rwanda.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Rwanda</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Rwanda accepts German protection and joins German East Africa</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/merina-kingdom"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Merina%20Kingdom.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Merina Kingdom</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">France abolishes the monarchy and exiles Ranavalona III</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/orange-free-state"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Orange%20Free%20State.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Orange Free State</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Defensive alliance with the South African Republic</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/cucuteni-trypillia-culture"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Cucuteni%E2%80%93Trypillia%20culture.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Cucuteni–Trypillia culture</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Vincenc Chvojka presents his Ukrainian finds to the 11th Congress of Archaeologists, the official date of the discovery of the Trypillia culture</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/zionism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Zionism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Zionism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The First Zionist Congress at Basel founds the Zionist Organization and adopts the Basel Program</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/queen-victoria"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Queen%20Victoria.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Queen Victoria</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Her Diamond Jubilee is held as a festival of the British Empire, with troops from all over the empire</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/seoul"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Seoul.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Seoul</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Gojong proclaims the Korean Empire and the city is temporarily called Hwangseong</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/benin-city"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Benin%20City.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Benin City</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A British force captures, sacks and burns Benin City and takes the bronzes from the palace</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/dresden-codex"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Dresden%20Codex.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Dresden Codex</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Paul Schellhas assigns letters to the gods named by its glyphs</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/benin-bronzes"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Benin%20Bronzes.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Benin Bronzes</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">British forces sacked Benin City and took the works of art decorating the royal palace and the nobility's residences</span></li></ul></section>
